A '''revitalisation (+)''' is a potion that restores the player's drained stats and prayer. It can be made with 78 [[Herblore]] by using a [[buchu leaf]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having a [[stinkhorn mushroom]] in the inventory. Making this potion gives 26.5 herblore experience.

The restore value obtained per dose is 11 + 30% of the player's base level.

This potion is the strong variant of the revitalisation potions, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

